@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Listar
GET {{base}}/books

### Filtro + orden + paginación
GET {{base}}/books?author=garcía&sort=-stock&page=1&limit=5

### 2. Detalle
GET {{base}}/books/1

### Inexistente (404)
GET {{base}}/books/999

### 3. Body incompleto (400)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": ""
}

### 4. Válido (201)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ficciones",
  "author": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "isbn": "9788420633114",
  "stock": 2
}

### 5. ISBN duplicado (409)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ficciones (otra edición)",
  "author": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "isbn": "9788420633114"
}

### 6. PUT parcial (200)
PUT {{base}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 10
}

### 7. PUT con stock negativo (400)
PUT {{base}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": -1
}

### 8. Borrar (204)
DELETE {{base}}/books/1

### Borrar de nuevo (404)
DELETE {{base}}/books/1
